  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The task is to rework the @PATCH operation in FedoraLdp using the all new ResourceFactory.  The OCFLPersistentStorageSession is currently handling the update operation for RDF source.  However the kernel service org.fcrepo.kernel.impl.services.UpdatePropertiesServiceImpl will need to be implemented.  When complete, the appropriate integration tests in FedoraLdpIT will  be turned back on and will pass.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Namely:  ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "FedoraLdpIT.testEmptyPatch()",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "FedoraLdpIT.testUpdateObjectGraph()",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "FedoraLdpIT.testDeleteMultipleMultiValuedProperties",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "FedoraLdpIT.testPatchBinary()",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "FedoraLdpIT.testPatchBinaryDescriptionWithBinaryProperties()",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "FedoraLdpIT.testPatchBinaryNameAndType()",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": " ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
