  "description": "<p>The task is to rework the @PATCH operation in FedoraLdp using the all new ResourceFactory.  The OCFLPersistentStorageSession is currently handling the update operation for RDF source.  However the kernel service org.fcrepo.kernel.impl.services.UpdatePropertiesServiceImpl will need to be implemented.  When complete, the appropriate integration tests in FedoraLdpIT will  be turned back on and will pass.</p>\n\n<p>Namely:  </p>\n\n<p>FedoraLdpIT.testEmptyPatch()</p>\n\n<p>FedoraLdpIT.testUpdateObjectGraph()</p>\n\n<p>FedoraLdpIT.testDeleteMultipleMultiValuedProperties</p>\n\n<p>FedoraLdpIT.testPatchBinary()</p>\n\n<p>FedoraLdpIT.testPatchBinaryDescriptionWithBinaryProperties()</p>\n\n<p>FedoraLdpIT.testPatchBinaryNameAndType()</p>\n\n<p> </p>",
